  "title": "Tropical Tiramisu",
  "description": "Try this tempting tiramisu with a tropical twist. Drizzle morsels of cake with mango nectar and rum, then layer with a fabulous pineapple and honey cream cheese, candied ginger and macadamia nuts. Chill and serve with slices of mango and pineapple.",
  "authors": [
    "Roxanne E Chan"
  ],
